  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Jost;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">GRIND TAPE Affiliate Partnership Agreement</h2><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Welcome to the GRIND Team</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">You’re not just signing up for an affiliate program — you’re joining the GRIND movement. We believe in building partnerships that empower creators, athletes, and everyday grinders to grow alongside us. This is about teamwork, purpose, and shared success.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">These terms exist to ensure a<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>powerful partnership where both sides win</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>— you grow your influence and earnings, while helping more people discover the benefits of better breathing, sleep, and performance.</p><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><hr></div><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">1. Getting Started</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Before any product is sent, we want to make sure you’re set up for success.<br>Joining means you’re part of something bigger — and we’ll support you every step of the way.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">By joining, you agree to:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Be part of a community that shares the GRIND mindset: consistency, authenticity, and growth.</p></li><li><p>Create and post content that represents the brand’s purpose in your unique voice.</p></li><li><p>Stay active and engaged with the team as the brand continues to grow.</p></li></ul><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><hr></div><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">2. Content Expectations</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We want your creativity to shine. All we ask is that you share your journey and experience with GRIND TAPE in your own authentic way.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">To stay active in the program:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Post<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>at least 1 reel and 2 stories</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>within<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>14 days</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>of receiving product.</p></li><li><p>Tag<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>@grind_tape</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>as a collaborator so we can celebrate your content.</p></li><li><p>Add your<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>affiliate link or code</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>in your bio or highlight so your audience can easily find it.</p></li><li><p>After your first posts, try to keep the energy going — share at least<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>1 new GRIND TAPE reel each month</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>to stay active and keep earning.</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We keep things simple — share your authentic experience with GRIND TAPE and inspire others to do the same.<br>And remember, we’ll be sharing ideas, templates, and content inspiration every month to help you grow.</p><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><hr></div><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">3. How Commissions Work</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We want your success to feel rewarding.</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Earn up to<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>20% commission</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>on all valid sales made through your unique link or code.</p></li><li><p>Track your performance easily through your affiliate dashboard.</p></li><li><p>Stay consistent and active to keep your tier — inactivity for over 30 days might affect your commission level.</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">The more you grow, the more you earn — it’s that simple.</p><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><hr></div><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">4. Brand Representation</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We trust our affiliates to represent GRIND TAPE with authenticity and confidence.<br>You don’t have to sound scripted — be yourself, speak your truth, and tell your story.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We just ask that you:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Keep it real and respectful.</p></li><li><p>Avoid misleading or harmful claims.</p></li><li><p>Show people the impact of GRIND TAPE through your own experience.</p></li></ul><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><hr></div><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">5. Product Usage</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We believe in authenticity above all.<br>Use GRIND TAPE personally before creating content — when you believe in the product, it shows.<br>Products sent are free and part of our collaboration with you as a valued partner.</p><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><hr></div><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">6. Partnership Standards</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We’re building a team of leaders — people who inspire others to take control of their health, habits, and performance.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We may remove affiliates who:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Don’t stay active or engaged.</p></li><li><p>Misrepresent the brand.</p></li><li><p>Repeatedly ignore guidelines or expectations.</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">But our goal isn’t to remove — it’s to help you grow. If you ever feel stuck, reach out to us directly. We’re here to help you win.</p><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><hr></div><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">7. Agreement</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">By signing up, you confirm that you:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Have read and agree to these partnership terms.</p></li><li><p>Understand the content and activity expectations.</p></li><li><p>Are ready to represent GRIND TAPE with pride, creativity, and authenticity.</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Welcome to the movement. Let’s grow together.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>The GRIND Team</strong></p></div>",
